scope: |
  The `sconcat` prim reads two Cons CELLS as two pairs and returns a TupleN: `a ++ b ++ c` on
  lists silently produces `(1, List(2,3), 4, List(5))` on the v2 VM and bytecode lanes. Fix both
  copies in the kernel plus the JvmBackend twin, and gate the int-vs-v2 divergence.
